5. Privacy Policy

Google Play الزامی می‌کند Privacy Policy داشته باشید.

5.1 محتوای پیشنهادی

فایل docs/PRIVACY_POLICY.md:

```markdown
# Privacy Policy – APZ Manager

**Last updated:** 2026-10-06

## Introduction

APZ Manager ("the App", "we") is an Android application for analyzing APK files
for security research and defensive purposes. This Privacy Policy explains how
we handle your information.

## Data We Do NOT Collect

APZ Manager is designed with privacy as a first principle. **We do not collect,
transmit, or store any personal data on our servers.** Specifically:

- ❌ No user accounts
- ❌ No telemetry/analytics
- ❌ No crash reports to third parties
- ❌ No advertising IDs
- ❌ No location data
- ❌ No contacts, photos, or media access

## Data Processed Locally

The App processes the following **only on your device**:

- **APK files you select for analysis**: copied temporarily to the app's cache,
  analyzed, then deleted automatically.
- **Analysis reports**: stored in the app's private SQLite database.
- **Settings & preferences**: stored in private SharedPreferences.

You can delete all data at any time via Settings or by uninstalling the App.

## Optional Network Features

The following features, **only when explicitly enabled by you**, contact
external services:

### VirusTotal API (opt-in)
- **What is sent**: SHA-256 hash of the APK file.
- **Purpose**: check if the file is known malware.
- **Their policy**: https://www.virustotal.com/gui/legal/privacy-policy

### MetaDefender Cloud (opt-in)
- **What is sent**: SHA-256 hash of the APK file.
- **Purpose**: check if the file is known malware.
- **Their policy**: https://www.opswat.com/legal/privacy-policy

### Ollama (opt-in, local/self-hosted)
- **What is sent**: analysis report JSON (no APK content).
- **Purpose**: AI-generated summary.
- **Note**: You provide your own Ollama server URL. We do not operate any
  server.

**None of these features are enabled by default.**

## Permissions

- **INTERNET**: used only for the optional network features above.
- **ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE**: to detect connectivity.
- **READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE**: to open APK files you select.
- **POST_NOTIFICATIONS**: for optional analysis completion alerts.

## Children's Privacy

The App is not directed to children under 13.

## Security

APK files are never executed. All analysis is static (byte-level inspection).

## Changes

We may update this policy; the "Last updated" date will change.

## Contact

- Email: privacy@apz-security.com
- GitHub: https://github.com/your-org/apz-manager/issues

## Open Source

APZ Manager is licensed under GPLv3. Source:
https://github.com/your-org/apz-manager
```

